  "title": "Evaluate a polynomial at x=3",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Evaluate a polynomial at x=3",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The one named variable is bound to scalar x. x^2 + 2*x + 1 at 3 equals 16; the standard Error Cluster is also observed.\n\nThe one named variable is bound to scalar x. x^2 + 2*x + 1 at 3 equals 16; the standard Error Cluster is also observed.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.formula.evaluation@1; compiled owned-value service.\nExpected:\noutput-result (f64) = 16\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
